ample note highlight text\" data-reason=\"text reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">Ticked staples stay off the ingredient list.</b> The Recipe can still call for one you forgot.</figcaption>\n<span class=\"tag\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"example tag label\" data-reason=\"label text reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">Example</span>\n</div>\n</figure>\n<div class=\"lists\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"staples list columns\" data-reason=\"columns re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<div class=\"stack\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"basics and custom staples column\" data-reason=\"column reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<div class=\"field\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"basics staples field\" data-reason=\"field reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<p class=\"lb\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"basics staples field label\" data-reason=\"label text reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">The basics</p>\n<div class=\"list\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"basics staples list\" data-reason=\"list re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"salt staple checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input checked=\"\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"salt staple checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>salt</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"olive oil staple checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input checked=\"\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"olive oil staple checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>olive oil</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"water staple checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"water staple checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>water</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"black pepper staple checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input checked=\"\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"black pepper staple checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>black pepper</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"butter staple checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"butter staple checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>butter</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-6\" data-name=\"sugar staple checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"sugar staple checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>sugar</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"custom staples field\" data-reason=\"field reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<p class=\"lb\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"custom staples field label\" data-reason=\"label text reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">Your own</p>\n<div class=\"mine\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"custom staples chip rack\" data-reason=\"rack re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<span class=\"mine__chip\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"soy sauce custom staple chip\" data-reason=\"chip re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\">soy sauce<button aria-label=\"Remove soy sauce\" class=\"chip__x\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"remove soy sauce chip button\" data-reason=\"button re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"x\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"small close icon\" data-reason=\"icon re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\" height=\"10\" width=\"10\"><use href=\"#x\"></use></svg></button></span>\n<span class=\"mine__chip\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"chicken stock custom staple chip\" data-reason=\"chip re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\">chicken stock<button aria-label=\"Remove chicken stock\" class=\"chip__x\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"remove chicken stock chip button\" data-reason=\"button re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"x\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"small close icon\" data-reason=\"icon re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\" height=\"10\" width=\"10\"><use href=\"#x\"></use></svg></button></span>\n</div>\n<label class=\"lb\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"add staple field label\" data-reason=\"label text reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" for=\"b1-add\">Add a staple</label>\n<input class=\"ln\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"add staple text input\" data-reason=\"value reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" id=\"b1-add\" placeholder=\"e.g. fish sauce\" type=\"text\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stack\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"spices column\" data-reason=\"column reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<div class=\"field\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"spices field\" data-reason=\"field reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<p class=\"lb\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"spices field label\" data-reason=\"label text reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\">Spices</p>\n<div class=\"rack2\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"spices checkbox grid\" data-reason=\"grid re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<div class=\"list\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"spices list column A\" data-reason=\"list re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"chilli flakes spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"chilli flakes spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>chilli flakes</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"cumin spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input checked=\"\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"cumin spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>cumin</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"paprika spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input checked=\"\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"paprika spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>paprika</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"oregano spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"oregano spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>oregano</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-5\" data-name=\"turmeric spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"turmeric spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>turmeric</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"spices list column B\" data-reason=\"list re-rendered from HTML snapshot on navigation\">\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cinnamon spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"cinnamon spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>cinnamon</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"curry powder spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"curry powder spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>curry powder</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"garlic powder spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"garlic powder spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>garlic powder</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"ginger spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"ginger spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>ginger</label>\n<label class=\"row\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"coriander spice checkbox row\" data-reason=\"checkbox state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\"><input data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2-1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"coriander spice checkbox\" data-reason=\"checked state reset from HTML snapshot on navigation\" type=\"checkbox\"/>coriander</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"action buttons row\">\n<button class=\"btn btn--quiet\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"back navigation button\" type=\"button\">Back</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"continue primary button\" data-reason=\"button label reset to authored text on navigation re-run\" type=\"button\">Continue</button>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-22T10:37:19.356528+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-22T10:41:50.477922+00:00",
      "id": "var_479ad1bf1a74",
