tag\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"example tag label\">Example</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"frag__grp\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"listed ingredients group\">\n<p class=\"frag__h\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"listed group header\">Listed</p>\n<p class=\"frag__n\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"listed ingredient: firm tofu\">firm tofu</p>\n<p class=\"frag__n\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"listed ingredient: jasmine rice\">jasmine rice</p>\n<p class=\"frag__n\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"listed ingredient: soy sauce\">soy sauce</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"frag__grp\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"not listed ingredients group\">\n<p class=\"frag__h\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"not listed group header\">Not listed</p>\n<p class=\"frag__n frag__n--out\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"not listed ingredient: salt (struck)\">salt</p>\n<p class=\"frag__n frag__n--out\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"not listed ingredient: olive oil (struck)\">olive oil</p>\n<p class=\"frag__n frag__n--out\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"not listed ingredient: black pepper (struck)\">black pepper</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"frag__note\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"fragment explanatory note\"><b data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"note emphasis text\">Ticked staples stay off the list.</b> The Recipe can still call for one you forgot.</p>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"form actions bar\">\n<button class=\"btn btn--quiet\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"back navigation button\" type=\"button\">Back</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"primary continue button\" type=\"button\">Continue</button>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>",
