data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"servings field label\">Servings</span>\n<div class=\"stepper\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"stepper control\"><button aria-label=\"One fewer serving\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"decrement servings button\" type=\"button\">−</button><output data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"current servings value display\">2</output><button aria-label=\"One more serving\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"increment servings button\" type=\"button\">+</button></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"eff__r\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"setting effect description\">Every quantity in the Recipe follows it.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-3\" data-name=\"kcal setting row\">\n<div class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-3-1\" data-name=\"setting control group\">\n<label class=\"lb\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"kcal per serving label\" for=\"c2-kcal\">kcal per serving</label>\n<input class=\"input input--sm\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"kcal per serving input\" id=\"c2-kcal\" type=\"text\" value=\"600\"/>\n</div>\n<p class=\"eff__r\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-3-2\" data-name=\"setting effect description\">A target. The Recipe may go over it.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4\" data-name=\"flags setting row\">\n<div class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1\" data-name=\"setting control group\">\n<fieldset class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"flags fieldset\">\n<legend class=\"lb\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"flags heading legend\">Flags</legend>\n<div class=\"flags\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"flags checkbox group\">\n<label class=\"flag\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"vegan flag checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"vegan flag checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>vegan</label>\n<label class=\"flag\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"vegetarian flag checkbox label\"><input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"vegetarian flag checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>vegetarian</label>\n<label class=\"flag\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"gluten free flag checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"gluten free flag checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>gluten free</label>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n<div class=\"eff\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-2\" data-name=\"flags effect column\">\n<p class=\"eff__r\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"flags effect description\"><b data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hard limit note\">A hard limit, never traded.</b> A chicken Recipe is cooked with firm tofu.</p>\n<p class=\"chain\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"ingredient substitution chain\"><span class=\"out\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"excluded original ingredient\">chicken</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arw\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"substitution arrow icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 12\"><use href=\"#arw\"></use></svg><span class=\"inn\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"included substitute ingredient\">firm tofu</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5\" data-name=\"allergies setting row\">\n<div class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1\" data-name=\"setting control group\">\n<fieldset class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"allergies fieldset\">\n<legend class=\"lb\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"allergies heading legend\">Allergies <span class=\"count\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"allergies selected count\">2 / 15</span></legend>\n<div class=\"rack\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"allergies checkbox rack\">\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"milk allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"milk allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>milk</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"egg allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"egg allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>egg</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"peanut allergy checkbox label\"><input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"peanut allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>peanut</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"tree nuts allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"tree nuts allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>tree nuts</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"sesame allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"sesame allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>sesame</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-6\" data-name=\"soy allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"soy allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>soy</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-7\" data-name=\"wheat allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"wheat allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>wheat</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-8\" data-name=\"fish allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-8-1\" data-name=\"fish allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>fish</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-9\" data-name=\"shellfish allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-9-1\" data-name=\"shellfish allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>shellfish</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-10\" data-name=\"mollusc allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-10-1\" data-name=\"mollusc allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>mollusc</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-11\" data-name=\"sulphites allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-11-1\" data-name=\"sulphites allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>sulphites</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-12\" data-name=\"lupin allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-12-1\" data-name=\"lupin allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>lupin</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-13\" data-name=\"celery allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-13-1\" data-name=\"celery allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>celery</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-14\" data-name=\"mustard allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-14-1\" data-name=\"mustard allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>mustard</label>\n<label class=\"all\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-15\" data-name=\"kiwi fruit allergy checkbox label\"><input data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-2-15-1\" data-name=\"kiwi fruit allergy checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>kiwi fruit</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"addline\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-3\" data-name=\"custom allergy add line\">\n<label class=\"lb--sub\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"custom allergy field label\" for=\"c2-other\">Another allergy</label>\n<input class=\"input\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"custom allergy text input\" id=\"c2-other\" placeholder=\"e.g. banana\" type=\"text\"/>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n<p class=\"eff__r\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-3-5-2\" data-name=\"allergies effect description\">Checked against every ingredient in the Recipe.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"foot\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n<div class=\"actions\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"footer actions bar\">\n<button class=\"btn btn--quiet\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"back navigation button\" type=\"button\">Back</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"save diet primary button\" type=\"button\">Save Diet</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"flow\" data-kid=\"2-2\" data-name=\"step 3 staples screen section\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-kid=\"2-2-1\" data-name=\"section label text\">Step 3 — Staples</p>\n<div class=\"screen\" data-kid=\"2-2-2\" data-name=\"staples screen panel\">\n<header class=\"bar\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"top app bar\"><div class=\"frame\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"app bar content frame\">\n<a class=\"lockup\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo link\" href=\"/\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mk\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"llama brand logo icon\" height=\"28\" viewbox=\"0 0 32 32\" width=\"28\"><g><rect class=\"mk-band\" height=\"8.8\" rx=\"1.8\" width=\"12.8\" x=\"9.6\" y=\"9.4\"></rect><ellipse class=\"mk-crown\" cx=\"15.2\" cy=\"9.6\" rx=\"9.8\" ry=\"4.6\" transform=\"rotate(-6 15.2 9.6)\"></ellipse></g><circle class=\"mk-head\" cx=\"16\" cy=\"22\" r=\"8.8\"></circle><g><rect class=\"mk-eye\" height=\"7.5\" rx=\"1.35\" width=\"2.9\" x=\"11.35\" y=\"18.35\"></rect><rect class=\"mk-eye\" height=\"7.5\" rx=\"1.35\" width=\"2.9\" x=\"17.75\" y=\"18.35\"></rect></g></svg>\n<span class=\"wordmark\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand wordmark text\">Chef Llama</span>\n</a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Site\" class=\"nav\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"main site navigation\"><span data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"nav link to pantry\">Pantry</span><span data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"nav link to saved recipes\">Saved</span><span data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"nav link to account\">Account</span></nav>\n</div></header>\n<nav aria-label=\"Setup\" class=\"steps\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"onboarding progress steps nav\"><div class=\"frame\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"steps nav container\">\n<a class=\"step step--done\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"completed step 1 devices link\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"step__n\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"step number badge\">1</span>Devices</a>\n<a class=\"step step--done\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"completed step 2 diet link\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"step__n\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"step number badge\">2</span>Diet</a>\n<a aria-current=\"step\" class=\"step\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"active step 3 staples link\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"step__n\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"step number badge\">3</span>Staples</a>\n<a class=\"step\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"upcoming step 4 cooking state link\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"step__n\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"step number badge\">4</span>Cooking state</a>\n</div></nav>\n<main class=\"frame page\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"staples form main content\">\n<header class=\"shelf\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"page title shelf header\">\n<div class=\"shelf__label\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"tilted label card\">\n<h1 class=\"shelf__h\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"page title\">Staples</h1>\n<p class=\"shelf__facts\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"page title caption\">5 ticked</p>\n</div>\n</header>\n<p class=\"eff__r\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"page intro description\"><b data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"explanation strong lead-in\">Ticked staples stay off the ingredient list.</b> The Recipe can still bring one in when it suits the dish, so you never add them again.</p>\n<div class=\"thead\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"table header row\">\n<p class=\"th\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"staples column header\">Staple</p>\n<p class=\"th\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"listed items column header\">On the ingredient list</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rows\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"staples grouping rows\">\n<div class=\"row\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"essentials staples row\">\n<div class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"setting control group\">\n<fieldset class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"basics fieldset\">\n<legend class=\"lb\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"basics heading legend\">The basics</legend>\n<div class=\"rack2\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"basics two-column rack\">\n<div data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"basics left column\">\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"salt staple list label\"><input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"salt staple checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>salt</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"olive oil staple list label\"><input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"olive oil staple checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>olive oil</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"water staple list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"water staple checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>water</label>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"basics right column\">\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"black pepper staple list label\"><input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"black pepper staple checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>black pepper</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"butter staple list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"butter staple checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>butter</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"sugar staple list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-1-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"sugar staple checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>sugar</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n<p class=\"names\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"essentials still-listed note\">water, butter, sugar</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"spices and herbs row\">\n<div class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"setting control group\">\n<fieldset class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"spices and herbs fieldset\">\n<legend class=\"lb\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"spices and herbs heading legend\">Spices and herbs</legend>\n<div class=\"rack2\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"spices and herbs two-column rack\">\n<div data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"spices left column\">\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"chilli flakes list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"chilli flakes checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>chilli flakes</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"cumin list label\"><input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"cumin checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>cumin</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"paprika list label\"><input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"paprika checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>paprika</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"oregano list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"oregano checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>oregano</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-5\" data-name=\"turmeric list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"turmeric checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>turmeric</label>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"spices right column\">\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cinnamon list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"cinnamon checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>cinnamon</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"curry powder list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"curry powder checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>curry powder</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"garlic powder list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"garlic powder checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>garlic powder</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"ginger list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"ginger checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>ginger</label>\n<label class=\"list\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"coriander list label\"><input data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"coriander checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>coriander</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n<p class=\"names\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"spices still-listed note\">chilli flakes, oregano, turmeric, cinnamon, curry powder, garlic powder, ginger, coriander</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3\" data-name=\"custom staples row\">\n<div class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1\" data-name=\"setting control group\">\n<fieldset class=\"set\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"custom staples fieldset\">\n<legend class=\"lb\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"custom staples heading legend\">Your own</legend>\n<div class=\"mine\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"custom staple chips container\">\n<span class=\"mine__chip\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"soy sauce custom staple chip\">soy sauce<button aria-label=\"Remove soy sauce\" class=\"chip__x\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"soy sauce remove button\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"x\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"close X icon\" height=\"10\" width=\"10\"><use href=\"#x\"></use></svg></button></span>\n<span class=\"mine__chip\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"chicken stock custom staple chip\">chicken stock<button aria-label=\"Remove chicken stock\" class=\"chip__x\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"chicken stock remove button\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"x\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"close X icon\" height=\"10\" width=\"10\"><use href=\"#x\"></use></svg></button></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"addline\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"custom staple add line\">\n<label class=\"lb--sub\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"custom staple label\" for=\"c2-add\">Add a staple</label>\n<input class=\"input\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"custom staple text input\" id=\"c2-add\" placeholder=\"e.g. fish sauce\" type=\"text\"/>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n<p class=\"names\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-4-3-2\" data-name=\"custom staples note\">Held for every Recipe, never listed.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"foot\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-5\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n<div class=\"actions\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"footer actions bar\">\n<button class=\"btn btn--quiet\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"back navigation button\" type=\"button\">Back</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-5-1-2\" data-name=\"continue primary button\" type=\"button\">Continue</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>",
