oming step link - Cooking state\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"step__n\" data-kid=\"3-1-4-1\" data-name=\"step number for Cooking state\">4</span>Cooking state</a>\n</div></nav>\n<main class=\"frame page\" data-kid=\"4\" data-name=\"diet settings page container\">\n<header data-kid=\"4-1\" data-name=\"diet section header\"><div class=\"shelf__label\" data-kid=\"4-1-1\" data-name=\"section label shelf badge\">\n<h1 class=\"shelf__h\" data-kid=\"4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"diet section heading\">Diet</h1>\n<p class=\"caps\" data-kid=\"4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section subtitle caption\">Required before the first cook</p>\n</div></header>\n<div class=\"pair\" data-kid=\"4-2\" data-name=\"diet name field block\">\n<label class=\"field__label\" data-kid=\"4-2-1\" data-name=\"diet name label\" for=\"d5-name\">Diet name</label>\n<span class=\"ob ob--req\" data-kid=\"4-2-2\" data-name=\"required badge\">Required</span>\n<div class=\"note\" data-kid=\"4-2-3\" data-name=\"diet name helper note container\">\n<p class=\"note__p\" data-kid=\"4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"diet name helper note text\">Saved as the name of this Diet. <b data-kid=\"4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"diet name note emphasized text\">The Pantry shows which one is in use.</b></p>\n</div>\n<input class=\"input\" data-kid=\"4-2-4\" data-name=\"diet name text input\" id=\"d5-name\" type=\"text\" value=\"Home\"/>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"d5-req\" class=\"pair\" data-kid=\"4-3\" data-name=\"dietary requirements field block\" role=\"group\">\n<p class=\"field__label\" data-kid=\"4-3-1\" data-name=\"dietary requirements heading label\" id=\"d5-req\">Dietary requirements</p>\n<span class=\"ob\" data-kid=\"4-3-2\" data-name=\"hard limit badge\">Hard limit</span>\n<div class=\"note\" data-kid=\"4-3-3\" data-name=\"dietary requirements note container\">\n<p class=\"note__p\" data-kid=\"4-3-3-1\" data-name=\"dietary requirements note text\"><b data-kid=\"4-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"dietary requirements note emphasized text\">A Recipe that breaks one is not offered.</b> The dish stays as it is; the conflicting ingredient is swapped.</p>\n<figure class=\"swap\" data-kid=\"4-3-3-2\" data-name=\"ingredient swap example caption\">\n<span data-kid=\"4-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"swap from ingredient text\">chicken</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swap__arrow\" data-kid=\"4-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"swap arrow indicator\">→</span><span data-kid=\"4-3-3-2-3\" data-name=\"swap to ingredient text\">firm tofu</span>\n<figcaption class=\"swap__why\" data-kid=\"4-3-3-2-4\" data-name=\"swap reason note\">breaks vegan</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bank\" data-kid=\"4-3-4\" data-name=\"diet option toggle grid\">\n<input checked=\"\" class=\"in\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-1\" data-name=\"vegan hidden checkbox\" id=\"d5-vegan\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n<label class=\"tile m-vegan\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-2\" data-name=\"vegan option tile\" for=\"d5-vegan\">\n<span class=\"ic\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"vegan icon sprite container\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lay body\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"vegan body icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#b-vegan\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lay part drift-sway\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"vegan leaf detail icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#p-vegan\"></use></svg></span>\n<span class=\"tile__name\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"vegan option label\">Vegan</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tick\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-2-3\" data-name=\"vegan checkmark icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><use href=\"#tick\"></use></svg>\n</label>\n<input checked=\"\" class=\"in\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-3\" data-name=\"vegetarian hidden checkbox\" id=\"d5-vegetarian\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n<label class=\"tile m-vegetarian\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-4\" data-name=\"vegetarian option tile\" for=\"d5-vegetarian\">\n<span class=\"ic\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-4-1\" data-name=\"vegetarian icon container\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lay body\" data-kid=\"4-3-4-4-1-