a-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"header bar with wordmark and spec facts\">\n<span class=\"wordmark\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"site wordmark\">Chef Llama</span>\n<p class=\"facts caps\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"design spec facts list\"><span data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"spec fact: shell count\">One shell</span><span data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"spec fact: indication count\">Two indications</span><span data-kid=\"2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"spec fact: corner radius\">4px corner</span><span data-kid=\"2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"spec fact: slot size\">20px slot</span></p>\n</div>\n<header class=\"head\" data-kid=\"2-2\" data-name=\"page hero header\">\n<h1 data-kid=\"2-2-1\" data-name=\"page title: The tile\">The tile</h1>\n<div class=\"lede\" data-kid=\"2-2-2\" data-name=\"hero intro paragraph group\">\n<p data-kid=\"2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"hero summary of the tile control\">Diet's requirements and the devices field are one control: a label over a hidden checkbox, a card, a gold fill, a mark, a name, and a pocket at the top corner. Only what sits in the pocket changes.</p>\n</div>\n</header>\n<section class=\"block\" data-kid=\"2-3\" data-name=\"section introducing the two fields\">\n<div class=\"block__head\" data-kid=\"2-3-1\" data-name=\"section heading block for the two fields\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"section heading: The two fields\">The two fields</h2>\n<p data-kid=\"2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"section description comparing the two fields\">Same markup. Diet passes no cap and no indication; devices pass a cap of three and the rank. The wash, the pocket and the press are one rule set.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bank-frame\" data-kid=\"2-3-2\" data-name=\"container for dietary tiles bank\" id=\"diet\">\n<div aria-label=\"Dietary requirements\" class=\"bank\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"dietary requirements tile bank\" role=\"group\">\n<label class=\"tile m-vegan is-on\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"vegan diet toggle tile\" data-value=\"vegan\"><input checked=\"\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"vegan hidden checkbox control\" data-reason=\"checked state is reinitialized by the bank() script\" type=\"checkbox\"/><span class=\"ic\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"vegan icon stack\"><svg class=\"lay body\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"vegan stem body icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#b-vegan\"></use></svg><svg class=\"lay part drift-sway\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"vegan leaf part with sway animation\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#p-vegan\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"tile__name\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"vegan tile name label\">Vegan</span><span class=\"tile__slot ind--tick\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-4\" data-name=\"vegan tick indicator slot\"><span class=\"pocket\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"vegan tick pocket backing\"></span><svg class=\"ind-tick\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"vegan tick checkmark icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><use href=\"#tick\"></use></svg></span></label>\n<label class=\"tile m-vegetarian is-on\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"vegetarian diet toggle tile\" data-value=\"vegetarian\"><input checked=\"\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"vegetarian hidden checkbox control\" data-reason=\"checked state is reinitialized by the bank() script\" type=\"checkbox\"/><span class=\"ic\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"vegetarian icon stack\"><svg class=\"lay body\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"vegetarian bean body icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#b-vegetarian\"></use></svg><svg class=\"lay part\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"vegetarian stem part icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#p-vegetarian\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"tile__name\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"vegetarian tile name label\">Vegetarian</span><span class=\"tile__slot ind--tick\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"vegetarian tick indicator slot\"><s