id=\"2-4-1\" data-name=\"states section heading block\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"states section heading: States\">States</h2>\n<p data-kid=\"2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"states section description text\">Every state is the shell's; neither indication adds one. Only the pocket's contents are the indication's business.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"register\" data-kid=\"2-4-2\" data-name=\"tile states register table\">\n<div class=\"reg-row reg-row--head\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"register header row\">\n<span class=\"reg-key\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"register key column header\"></span>\n<span class=\"reg-h\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"rest state column header\">Rest</span>\n<span class=\"reg-h\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-1-3\" data-name=\"hover state column header\">Hover</span>\n<span class=\"reg-h\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-1-4\" data-name=\"focus state column header\">Focus</span>\n<span class=\"reg-h\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-1-5\" data-name=\"filling state column header\">Filling</span>\n<span class=\"reg-h\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-1-6\" data-name=\"checked state column header\">Checked</span>\n<span class=\"reg-h\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-1-7\" data-name=\"at limit state column header\">At limit</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reg-row\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"register row for tick indication states\">\n<span class=\"reg-key\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"tick row label key\">Tick</span>\n<span class=\"reg-cell\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"tick rest state cell\"><span class=\"tile is-static m-gluten\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"tick rest state tile specimen\"><span class=\"ic\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"tick specimen icon stack\"><svg class=\"lay body\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"gluten-free body icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#b-gluten\"></use></svg><svg class=\"lay part\" data-kid=\"2-4-2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"gluten-free wheat part icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><use href=\"#p-gluten\"></use></svg>